    "You make a password just for Causabee. It is kept in your iCloud Keychain and goes only to your mail provider.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du legst ein Passwort nur für Causabee an. Es liegt in deinem iCloud-Schlüsselbund und geht nur an deinen Mail-Anbieter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which mail do you use?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welche Mail nutzt du?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick the one you want Causabee to read. You can add another later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wähl die, die Causabee lesen soll. Eine weitere kannst du später hinzufügen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also Google Workspace at work": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auch Google Workspace in der Arbeit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another provider": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein anderer Anbieter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Outlook and Hotmail can’t be read by apps like Causabee yet — Microsoft only lets its own apps in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Outlook und Hotmail können Apps wie Causabee noch nicht lesen — Microsoft lässt nur eigene Apps hinein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Gmail address": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Gmail-Adresse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your iCloud address": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine iCloud-Adresse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your mail address": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Mail-Adresse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The one whose mail Causabee should read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die, deren Mail Causabee lesen soll."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next, %@ makes a password just for Causabee. It takes about a minute.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als Nächstes legt %@ ein Passwort nur für Causabee an. Das dauert etwa eine Minute."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Outlook can’t be connected yet — continue to see what works instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Outlook lässt sich noch nicht verbinden — weiter, um zu sehen, was stattdessen geht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Outlook can’t be connected yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Outlook lässt sich noch nicht verbinden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Microsoft lets only its own apps read Outlook and Hotmail mail. That isn’t something Causabee can change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Microsoft lässt nur eigene Apps Outlook- und Hotmail-Mail lesen. Daran kann Causabee nichts ändern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What works instead:": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was stattdessen geht:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forward the mails you want sorted to a Gmail or iCloud address, and connect that.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leite die Mails, die einsortiert werden sollen, an eine Gmail- oder iCloud-Adresse weiter und verbinde die."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Or drop a mail’s PDF or a screenshot into Causabee — it sorts those too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oder zieh das PDF einer Mail oder einen Screenshot in Causabee — die sortiert sie auch ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which provider is it?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welcher Anbieter ist es?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee couldn’t find the settings for %@ by itself. Pick your provider:": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee konnte die Einstellungen für %@ nicht selbst finden. Wähl deinen Anbieter:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not listed? Enter the settings yourself ›": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nicht dabei? Gib die Einstellungen selbst ein ›"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your provider’s settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Einstellungen deines Anbieters"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your provider’s help pages name them — look for “IMAP”. Causabee connects securely, usually on port 993.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Hilfeseiten deines Anbieters nennen sie — such nach „IMAP“. Causabee verbindet sich sicher, meist über Port 993."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Incoming mail server": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Server für eingehende Mail"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Port": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Port"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Many providers want a password made for apps rather than your usual one. Their settings say so.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Viele Anbieter wollen ein Passwort für Apps statt deines üblichen. Ihre Einstellungen sagen es."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste the 16 letters": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die 16 Buchstaben einfügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s it — %@ Connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das war's — %@ Verbinden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee noticed something on your clipboard — %@ Paste to use it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee hat etwas in deiner Zwischenablage gesehen — %@ Einfügen, um es zu nehmen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy the 16 letters at Google, then %@ Paste.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kopier die 16 Buchstaben bei Google, dann %@ Einfügen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make a password for Causabee": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Passwort für Causabee anlegen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Google gives apps like Causabee their own password, so your real one is never shared.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Google gibt Apps wie Causabee ein eigenes Passwort, damit dein echtes nie weitergegeben wird."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ “Open Google” and sign in if asked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ „Google öffnen“ und melde dich an, wenn du gefragt wirst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type “Causabee” as the app name, then %@ Create.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gib „Causabee“ als App-Namen ein, dann %@ Erstellen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Google shows 16 letters. Copy them and come back here.": {
      "localizations": {
