      "localizations": {}
    },
    "%@ wants its separate mail password": {
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "First, one check at Google": {
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "Google makes a password for apps only when 2-Step Verification is on. Many accounts have it — but not always when you sign in with a passkey.": {
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "%@ “Check at Google” and sign in if asked.": {
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "If Google offers to turn it on, do it and add your phone number. Your passkey stays as it is.": {
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "Come back here — Causabee keeps your place.": {
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "At work or on your own domain, whoever runs your Google account may have to allow 2-Step Verification first.": {
      "localizations": {}
    },
